OL,3,AADHD and autism at risk of
OL,4,Aover-diagnosis, says report, as author
OL,5,Awarns of rise in mental ill health
OL,6,
OL,7,FErin, now 21, says being diagnosed as
OL,8,Fautistic at college helped her
OL,9,Funderstand what support she needed: "I
OL,10,Fcould know exactly what I wanted to
OL,11,Fsay, but I physically couldn't get the
OL,12,Fwords out"
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/42
