OL,3,ANavi Pillay, former UN human rights
OL,4,Acommissioner, wins Nobel Peace Prize
OL,5,
OL,6,FLast year's winner, Venezuelan
OL,7,Fopposition leader Maria Corina Machado,
OL,8,Fultimately gave her medal to Trump in
OL,9,FJanuary - here's why
OL,11,FOriginally from Durban in South Africa,
OL,12,FPillay was president of the
OL,13,Finternational tribunal on Rwanda's
OL,14,Fgenocide between the late 1990s and
OL,15,Fearly 2000s
OL,17,FMore recently, she was part of the
OL,18,FIndependent International Commission of
OL,19,FInquiry on the Occupied Palestinian
OL,20,FTerritory, created by the UN Human
OL,21,FRights Council in 2021
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/42
