OL,3,AFrance promises 3,000 extra teachers in
OL,4,Afirst step to calm student protests
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn what unions have billed as Act Four
OL,7,Fof the three-week movement, some 71,000
OL,8,Fpeople staged protests across the
OL,9,Fcountry on Thursday, with 24,000
OL,10,Fgathering at the Bastille in Paris.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG17/42
